|url=http://www.news.com.au/heraldsun/story/0,21985,22653762-5005961,00.html 
|accessdate=2007-11-13}} </ref><ref> {{cite news
|first=Phillip 
|last=Coorey 
|title=Forget interest rates ad, it only ran two nights: PM
