|url=http://www.smh.com.au/news/federalelection2007news/transcript-howards-twonight-stand/2007/10/26/1192941339466.html 
|accessdate=2007-11-13}} </ref> During the 2004 campaign, Howard was also cited as giving the same promise, personally, on radio.<ref> {{cite news
|first=Michelle 
